-- src:817 | (i) the law to which the body corporate is subject, and its constitution (whether set out in its articles of association or other governing documents);
-- src:818 | (ii) the full names of the board of directors (or if there is no board, the members of the equivalent management body) and the senior persons responsible for the operations of the body corporate.
