-- reg 28(7).  This paragraph applies if (and only if) the relevant person has exhausted all possible means of identifying the beneficial owner of the body
-- corporate and (a) has not succeeded in doing so, or (b) is not satisfied that the individual identified is in fact the beneficial owner.
-- src:826 | (7) This paragraph applies if (and only if) the relevant person has exhausted all possible means of identifying the beneficial owner of the body corporate and—
-- src:827 | (a) has not succeeded in doing so, or
-- src:828 | (b) is not satisfied that the individual identified is in fact the beneficial owner.
@ref reg 28(7) (src:826-828)
GIVEN `the relevant person has exhausted all possible means of identifying the beneficial owner of the body corporate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it has not succeeded in identifying the beneficial owner` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is not satisfied that the individual identified is in fact the beneficial owner` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`reg 28(7) this paragraph applies` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the relevant person has exhausted all possible means of identifying the beneficial owner of the body corporate` AND (`it has not succeeded in identifying the beneficial owner` OR `it is not satisfied that the individual identified is in fact the beneficial owner`) THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This paragraph applies if (and only if) the relevant person has exhausted all possible means of identifying the beneficial owner of the body corporate and (a) has not succeeded in doing so, or (b) is not satisfied that the individual identified is in fact the beneficial owner"

-- reg 28(6).  If the customer is a body corporate, and paragraph (7) applies, the relevant person may treat the senior person in that body corporate
-- responsible for managing it as its beneficial owner.
-- src:825 | (6) If the customer is a body corporate, and paragraph (7) applies, the relevant person may treat the senior person in that body corporate responsible for managing it as its beneficial owner.
@ref reg 28(6) (src:825-825)
