`reg 28(6) the relevant person may treat the senior person responsible for managing the body corporate as its beneficial owner` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `reg 3(1) the entity is a body corporate` EQUALS JUST TRUE AND `reg 28(7) this paragraph applies` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `reg 3(1) the entity is a body corporate` EQUALS JUST FALSE OR `reg 28(7) this paragraph applies` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If the customer is a body corporate, and paragraph (7) applies, the relevant person may treat the senior person ..." (Marginal readings, (a): a failed condition of an "if")
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): regulation 3(1) or paragraph (7) has not answered

